Z||000019||AusFiero||08-18-2001||08:17 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Stage-2GT:<BR><B> Is this going to be definite Aus? Have you worked out the Targa support system yet? I may just have to start saving for my next Fiero project. I like it alot Aus, you DA MAN!!!</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Well it will be made if my wife has her way Stage-2GT. She got real interested in having a Fiero of her own after seeing that. Mind  you money will be the deciding factor. How much stuff I sell in the next year and whether I have made enough to support development. <P>The targa support system I was kinda hoping someone with a USA targa or convertible would post some pictures of the underside. I know what it would take to make it legal in my state. But with 52 American states I think it will need to be damn tough to meet everyones registration requirements.<P>An X member, plating/boxing of existing chassis parts is what I had in mind.<BR>||||reg||1
